List of API Routes (v0.1.0)

  All query parameters are required unless specified otherwise.

/corpus
  Lists 20 entries from the database.

/corpus/find_info
Query Parameters:
  name: Name of the person
  company [optional]: Name of the company where the person works at
  username [optional]: Username of a social media account that the person owns

  Find publicly available information about a given person.

/corpus/search
Query Parameters:
  name: Name of the person
  username [optional]: Username of a social media account that the person owns

  Search the database based on name or, optionally, username.


Current JSON Data Structure (v0.1.0)
{
  "timestamp": "<creation timestamp>",
  "version": "<version at the time of creation>",
  "name": "Person name",
  "images": [
    {
      "url": "<image url>",
      "isRelevant": true | false
    },
    ...
  ],
  "socials": [
    {
      "url": "<image url>",
      "isRelevant": true | false
    }
  ],
  "userAccount": {
    "<username>": {
      "<website>": {
        "url": "<account url>",
        "isRelevant": true | false
      },
      ...
    }
  }
}